   Full text: https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc/4.0/

The motifs themselves belong to the Anatolian weaving tradition and to the
women who wove them; the catalog draws on Mine Erbek, Çatalhöyük'ten Günümüze
Anadolu Motifleri (T.C. Kültür Bakanlığı). The printed page images are not part
of this repository.
